{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_lava_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_lava_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "看护",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lava_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "08f572a7e598f1843e1e84193896a6bd380895a9dabfd7cfbf618e78be988fd6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——\n啪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊......吵死了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉，快起床。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎么都不应一声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不会是在想怎么赖床吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "昨天晚上还发消息给我说什么要去巡诊，让我早点叫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "结果我起来了，你还睡着，哈啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唉，爱睡就睡吧，我洗漱去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉你怎么还睡着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "起床啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我也才刚出过外勤回来，这次任务不容易，麻烦得很，除了我也没几个人能应付。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "本来阿米娅可给我放了好几天假，我能睡一整天的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "要不是为了叫你，我也不会闭眼一两个小时就，哈啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "还不醒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那我可要动手了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "昨晚你自己说的，你已经是医疗部的精英之一了，绝对不能迟到，拖也要把你拖起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "虽然也不是第一次说这样的话了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "但真有机会把你拖出被窝还是头一回。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "哼哼。要是没我，你可怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "还不起？我真的要掀了啊，着凉了别怪我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉，你，你怎么了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "手怎么那么烫？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉？姐？你别吓我啊，你身体不是一直不错的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎么突然就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "姐，姐，说句话啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我醒了......炎熔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "别晃了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "哦，抱，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "有点冷......没力气......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "应该是发烧了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "发烧，你也会发烧吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊对了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "稍微等我一下，我现在就帮你找医生来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "不是什么大问题......小炎熔你不用......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "哎......这孩子也真是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十分钟后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉，我把医生找来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "安赛尔，快帮忙看看，芙蓉还好吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "等等，你别急，哎别这样拉我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "真是的......我还想你突然抓住我有什么事情，原来是你姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我没......事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "病人可没资格说“没事”这两个字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "你们宿舍有体温计吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "有，有的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "在家庭医药箱里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我这就去拿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "你不要紧吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "只是......发烧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "体温有点高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "使不上力，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "医药箱呢，我记得在这里的啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "这两天饮食和作息上还好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "健......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "健康餐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "算了，当我没问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "你和亚叶应该都属于不需要担心的那种人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "可能是前段时间太劳累了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "找到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "一会......该做的检测......麻烦你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这样她......能安心一点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "给，体温计！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "请把整个箱子都拿过来，这样我能给芙蓉做所有的基础检测。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "她的医药箱里这些设备应该都有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "有足够的数据支撑，我就可以判别她的发热到底是触发了身体防御机制，还是由其他症状引起的并发症。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "先从检测体温开始，来，张嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎，怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "没什么大碍，就是身体的自主调整过程比较激烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "劳累过度应该是主因。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "这两天好好休息，很快就能恢复。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "饮食清淡一点，少盐少糖，注意营养均衡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "也就是说要我给她做健康餐吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "食堂也提供类似的餐品，也不一定要亲自做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "其他的要点，芙蓉自己都清楚，我就不列举了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "医疗部那里我会帮芙蓉请病假的，芬那边也会和她说一声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "你们两个后面几天没有外勤或是其他任务吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这倒是没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "没有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "那就应该没什么问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安赛尔",
      "text": "没有什么要问了的话，我就先走了，芙蓉的看护就交给你了，炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唉——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我要看护你一两天是吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我没学过护理课。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "小炎熔......要去训练的话......就去吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "姐姐......可是医生......没有那么弱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "自己可以......照顾......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "咳、咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你别多说话！嗓子疼不疼？要不要喝点水？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "没事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "所以说，呃，不是，我没说不想照顾你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "就是，那个，我，我没什么经验......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "要是什么地方弄错了。你不舒服了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你就说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "炎熔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那就这么定了。现在先吃个早饭，一会我去做，吃完我洗碗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你会不会没胃口？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "不会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那要不要先拿个脸盆让你洗漱一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "等我一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（拉了下炎熔的衣角）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊，还有什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（做了个谢谢的口型）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "没什么好谢的，你生个病，我多两天假期，还算划得来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "呃，之前那个脸盆放哪里去了？\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "哈......总算弄完了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "护理还真麻烦啊，一点都不酷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "要我当众做这种事我肯定要拒绝的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "饱了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（点点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那就别睁着眼睛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "闭上，好好休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我去洗脸盆，然后去洗碗，再然后——还没想好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唉反正就先这样，有什么事情，把这个闹钟的闹铃时间调一下，听到声音我就过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "听话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（拍拍芙蓉的脸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯......刷子，还有洗洁精。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（我刚刚是不是拍了拍芙蓉的脸？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爸爸妈妈会想念你们的。\n记得经常来信。\n听话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（爸爸妈妈就喜欢这样对我们。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（也不知道上周寄出去的信他们有没有收到。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（嗯......是不是芙蓉也会这么对我？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "该吃健康餐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "听话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（呃......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（她要是那样，多半是想命令我做什么。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（刚刚那一顿肉粥，也不知道她吃饱没有。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（要不要给她削个水果呢？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（还是烤点肉？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（真的有点想在她床前架个火炉自己烤肉吃。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（馋死她。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（还是削个水果吧......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我切了点水果，你要吃吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "Zzz……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "睡得还挺沉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这家伙睡觉的时候看上去倒也没那么讨厌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（捏了捏芙蓉的脸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "Zzz……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "还是很烫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "希望她能恢复一点，这样我还能心安理得对她做些恶作剧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "哈啊......忙活了半天，我也有点累了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "在她床边睡一会吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "Zzz......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滴滴滴滴——\n啪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "吵醒你了吗，抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这是给你热粥的闹铃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "现在就吃吗，还是过一会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "现在就吃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我自己来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "唉唉唉别起来，昨天刚累倒今天就想活蹦乱跳吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "给 我 躺 下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唔呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（芙蓉什么时候力气那么大了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我稍微打听了一下，是Pith小姐带你出去特训搞成这样的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不是Pith老师的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "本来这次就是高强度的训练安排，最开始看起来会比较严酷，不过万事开头难嘛，之后习惯了就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那也不能训练完就虚成这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我觉得值。这样训练下来，我能感觉到自己越来越强了，无论是源石技艺的精准度还是其他方面的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "况且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "况且？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这次特训前其实我有被提醒过，因为训练强度比较大，过程会比较艰苦所以要做好心理准备之类的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我和教官们说：“没关系的，我姐姐是医疗干员，就算去掉半条命，只要还有一口气在，她都能给我救回来。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "大概是这么个意思，意会一下就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "小炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这次就算了，要是之后特训完你的状态还是这样，我会正式向人事部提出异议。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这个也不至于——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我不管这种训练能带给你多少提升，我只关心这会不会对你的身体造成伤害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "至少，你不能......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "对不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉？姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "别，别哭啊，都多大的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你知道我找到你的时候有多担心吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这不是没事嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "也就是体力有些透支，加上一点小擦伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "不是，不是这次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你还记得，自己是怎么来罗德岛的吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "这个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "在路上帮一群商人击退匪徒的时候，被人发现是感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "然后就被商队留下断后......我记得当时谁砸了我的脑袋，我就昏过去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "再醒过来就发现自己在罗德岛上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "伤也被人治好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "听说是出外勤的干员顺手把我捞回来的？还好只是受了点小伤，没怎么麻烦别人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "是重伤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我本来以为失散之后能见到个和往常一样别扭的你，但......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你就躺在手术台上，小炎熔，烧得像个火球......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我却，帮不上任何忙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我唯一能做的，就是在手术结束后帮你做护理......就像现在这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那个时候，你也不停在床上喊我的名字......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "什么？等下，我从没听说过这种事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那，那你为什么不说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "还不是因为知道你这家伙别扭起来就不听话，好不容易才找到你，万一你又跑了怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "所以你恢复意识到入职前，我都不敢出现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我也没，这么不讲道理吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "当然有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我们出维多利亚的时候不就是因为炎熔你闹别扭才走散的吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那，那是个意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "总之，不许再发生这样的事了，明白没？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（小声）好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯，这样才乖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啊对了，你做了个什么梦啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "要是不介意的话，可以放心地把梦境内容分享给姐姐，这样对恢复精神有好处哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯，我听着呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我......我梦见......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "梦见什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "梦见芙蓉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我怎么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "说吧，我听着呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（拍拍炎熔的脸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那快说吧，到底梦见什么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（不行，太难为情了！说不出口！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "什么都没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "听话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不听！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我什么梦都没做！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "小炎熔怎么一醒来就闹别扭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "别扭倒是挺常见的，脸怎么也红红的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "难道又发烧了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "乖乖躺着，给你量个体温。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "量体温，干嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "别把体温计拿过来，我没发烧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "病人可没资格说“没事”这两个字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "脸红和发烧你分不清吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "为什么见到姐姐要脸红呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "还、还不是因为你在梦里生病了说话都没力气的样子真要说给你听很丢脸啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "大概......就是这么个梦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嘿嘿，听完还让人感觉挺高兴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "还不是因为芙蓉......姐姐你平时......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我才没那么容易垮呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯，但意外总是难以避免的，所以以后可能真的会需要炎熔来看护。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "当然啦，我一直是相信炎熔会在姐姐危难的时候帮上忙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "虽然平时又不听话、又倔强、主意又多、动作还特别快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你这是在拐弯抹角数落我吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "没有哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "有东西吃嘛，我有点饿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "有，有的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "太好了，难得小炎熔这么配合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "稍等一下，我这就给你拿过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（原来那时候，姐姐也在啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（我就在想怎么有个声音这么熟悉。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（如果不是约翰老师，芙蓉应该见不到我了吧......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（不知道老师在莱塔尼亚过得怎么样了，像他这样有才华的音乐家，应该已经打出名声了吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（信......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（也不知道爸妈什么时候会回信......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（大家......过得都很艰难......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（如果我能更强大的话......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "来啦来啦，这是新鲜出炉的粥哦，趁热吃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（闻了闻）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好像没什么味道，不是肉粥吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你梦里才是肉粥，这是最新研发的健康粥哦，好吃又健康！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（健康？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你，等等，难道你把你自己做的那个什么健康粉撒粥里了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "没错。这样会好吸收一点，也能更快把营养成分送入身体。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "姑且问一句......你自己尝过味道吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "当然啦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "姐姐一日三餐都在吃哦，营养特别均衡。所以生病的才是小炎熔而不是姐姐我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "来尝尝吧，健康才是最重要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不要，我一口都不会喝的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这是我好不容易改良出来的，尝尝嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我才不会信！上次你也说改良，结果还不是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唔唔！！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好像，味道是有点，能接受了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "对吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "？！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "恶，不对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不对不对，这个回味，怎么回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呕，你说的改良难道就只是让味道滞后吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "是呀，这样是不是能一口气把粥喝完了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "芙蓉，我和你没完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "记着，我跟你......呕......没完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
